    "withResolvers": "# Field Notes\n\nThe harbor was **_quiet_** before 2026-09-25 — see [Project Atlas Brief](Project%20Atlas%20Brief.md) and ask @Inès Moreau[. Map](https://example.com/map)\n\n- Tide tables\n  1. `Low tide 06:12`\n- [ ] Book the ferry (due 2026-10-02 09:30)\n- [x] ~~Pack the tide book~~\n\n<details><summary>Packing list</summary></details>\n\n  Wool, notebook, thermos\n\n> Slow is smooth.\n\n> [!INFO]\n> Ferries run hourly after nine.\n\n---\n\n```swift\nlet tide = Tide(height: 1.2)\nprint(tide)\n```\n\n![Harbor at dawn](assets/file_harbor.bin)\n_Before the first ferry_\n\n[timetable.pdf](assets/file_timetable.bin)\n\n| Day | Plan |\n| --- | --- |\n| Sat | _Lighthouse walk_ |\n\n[[Trip Sketch]]\n\n[Tide almanac](https://example.com/tides)\n\n<!-- folevi:collection 01JAGOLDCOL000000000000001 -->\n\n<!-- folevi:unsupported-block timeline -->\n",
    "withTitle": "---\ncreated: \"2026-09-25\"\ntags: \"travel \\\"sea\\\"\"\n---\n\n# Field Notes & \\[Tides\\]\n\n## Field Notes\n\nThe harbor was **_quiet_** before 2026-09-25 — see [[Project Atlas Brief]] and ask @Inès Moreau[. Map](https://example.com/map)\n\n- Tide tables\n  1. `Low tide 06:12`\n- [ ] Book the ferry (due 2026-10-02 09:30)\n- [x] ~~Pack the tide book~~\n\n<details><summary>Packing list</summary></details>\n\n  Wool, notebook, thermos\n\n> Slow is smooth.\n\n> [!INFO]\n> Ferries run hourly after nine.\n\n---\n\n```swift\nlet tide = Tide(height: 1.2)\nprint(tide)\n```\n\n![Harbor at dawn]()\n_Before the first ferry_\n\n[timetable.pdf]()\n\n| Day | Plan |\n| --- | --- |\n| Sat | _Lighthouse walk_ |\n\n[[Trip Sketch]]\n\n[Tide almanac](https://example.com/tides)\n\n<!-- folevi:collection 01JAGOLDCOL000000000000001 -->\n\n<!-- folevi:unsupported-block timeline -->\n"
